1
00:00:02,680 --> 00:00:04,680
早上好 准老公
Good morning, almost husband!

2
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:05,900
早上好 准...
Good morning, almost...

3
00:00:07,680 --> 00:00:08,940
淡定一点啦
Oh, calm down.

4
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:10,080
这肯定不是你们第一次
This can't be the first time

5
00:00:10,080 --> 00:00:12,120
醒来发现有别的男人在卧室里
you woke up with another men in your bedroom.

6
00:00:12,120 --> 00:00:13,280
新婚快乐哦
Happy wedding day!

7
00:00:13,740 --> 00:00:14,900
你们在这里干什么
What are you doing here?

8
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:17,220
你们订的是全方位服务婚礼
You pay for a full-service wedding,

9
00:00:17,220 --> 00:00:19,100
自然会享受我们的全套"家伙儿"
you get our full packages.

10
00:00:19,720 --> 00:00:22,260
接近了 亲爱的 很接近了
Oh, close, honey, so close.

11
00:00:22,260 --> 00:00:25,100
-我们要穿过来 -穿过来
- And we are crossing... - We're crossing

12
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:26,440
放下餐盘
and trays down.

13
00:00:26,440 --> 00:00:28,007
铺上餐巾
Napkin.

14
00:00:29,220 --> 00:00:30,920
放轻松 好好享受
Relax. Enjoy.

15
00:00:30,933 --> 00:00:33,040
4点车会来接你们
The car will pick you up at 4:00

16
00:00:33,040 --> 00:00:36,260
把你们送到美丽的山顶婚礼会场
to whisk you away to your beautiful hilltop wedding.

17
00:00:36,460 --> 00:00:36,880
天气怎么样
How's the weather?

18
00:00:37,020 --> 00:00:38,160
我梦到下了瓢泼大雨
I had a dream it rained on everyone.

19
00:00:38,280 --> 00:00:39,020
晴空万里
Dry as a bone.

20
00:00:39,120 --> 00:00:40,940
今晚从天而降的只有汉子们
The only thing it will be raining tonight is men.

21
00:00:41,120 --> 00:00:42,220
我们迫切需要呢
We really need it.

22
00:00:42,320 --> 00:00:43,500
萨尔有消息了吗
Has anyone heard from Sal?

23
00:00:43,780 --> 00:00:44,200
没有
No.

24
00:00:44,360 --> 00:00:45,680
我真心不明白你们为什么
And I will never understand

25
00:00:45,680 --> 00:00:48,140
要请那个成天醉醺醺的老巫婆
why you asked that boozy us-hag to

26
00:00:48,140 --> 00:00:49,020
主持你们的婚礼
officiate your wedding.

27
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:51,240
我们并没有邀请萨尔
We didn't exactly ask Sal.

28
00:00:51,940 --> 00:00:52,360
萨尔
Sal...

29
00:00:53,460 --> 00:00:55,800
我们有件很重要的事要跟你谈谈
...we have something very important to talk to you about.

30
00:00:55,900 --> 00:00:57,980
对 我们希望你能考虑一下...
Yeah, we hope that maybe you would be open to the idea --

31
00:00:57,980 --> 00:01:00,460
好的 我非常愿意主持你们的婚礼
Yes! I will totally officiate your wedding!

32
00:01:01,040 --> 00:01:03,040
我的酒啊
Oh, my drinks!

33
00:01:04,900 --> 00:01:06,920
我们本来是要劝她戒酒的
It was supposed to be an intervention.

34
00:01:21,860 --> 00:01:23,260
喂 伴郎
Hey, best man.

35
00:01:23,520 --> 00:01:24,900
你好 娇羞新娘
Hello, blushing bride.

36
00:01:25,040 --> 00:01:26,500
我不太喜欢这个称呼
I feel like I should hate that more.

37
00:01:26,500 --> 00:01:28,460
对 我也觉得你应该叫我"伴人"
Yeah, I think I might go with "Best person."

38
00:01:28,760 --> 00:01:29,400
不管怎样 我是想问问
Anyway, I'm just calling

39
00:01:29,400 --> 00:01:30,120
你们准备得如何了
to see how you're doing.

40
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:31,000
我很好啊
I'm great.

41
00:01:31,620 --> 00:01:32,020
真的吗
Really?

42
00:01:32,378 --> 00:01:34,120
我 又是老妈的事吗
I-I-- is this about mom again?

43
00:01:34,120 --> 00:01:35,480
我早就跟你说了 我没事
I told you -- I'm fine.

44
00:01:35,940 --> 00:01:37,460
我母亲不能来参加婚礼
My mother can't come to the wedding.

45
00:01:37,720 --> 00:01:39,200
她在一家瑜伽隐修所修炼
She was at a yoga retreat,

46
00:01:39,260 --> 00:01:40,620
做一个战士瑜伽式的时候摔倒了
and she fell out of a warrior pose,

47
00:01:40,620 --> 00:01:41,560
摔坏了屁股
and she broke her hip.

48
00:01:41,840 --> 00:01:43,540
我们能不能考虑一下
Should we consider the possibility

49
00:01:43,540 --> 00:01:44,360
可能是有人推倒了她呢
that someone pushed her?

50
00:01:44,420 --> 00:01:45,320
小卡 拜托
Cam, please.

51
00:01:45,551 --> 00:01:47,200
他们不过是一群爱好和平的嬉皮士
They were a bunch of peace-loving hippies

52
00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:49,180
跟我母亲在雨林里共度了两个星期
who spent two weeks in the rainforest with my mother.

53
00:01:49,180 --> 00:01:51,000
肯定是有人推她的
Of course someone pushed her.

54
00:01:51,780 --> 00:01:53,940
她不来其实还让我松了一口气
I'm actually relieved she's not coming.

55
00:01:53,940 --> 00:01:54,832
这样我的婚礼就不会出状况
She's given me the gift

56
00:01:54,832 --> 00:01:55,940
算是她送的大礼
of a crazy-free wedding.

57
00:01:55,940 --> 00:01:58,060
我知道 我只是有点同情你
I know. I was just a little sad for you.

58
00:01:58,069 --> 00:01:59,080
老妈爽约了
Mom's a no-show,

59
00:01:59,080 --> 00:02:00,860
你和老爸又几乎不说话
and you and dad are hardly even speaking.

60
00:02:01,140 --> 00:02:02,040
别再说老爸的事了
Enough about Dad.

61
00:02:02,320 --> 00:02:04,140
他不能理解同性恋婚礼
He doesn't get gay weddings,

62
00:02:04,140 --> 00:02:06,210
我也不理解运动服竟然可以当便装穿
and I don't get track suits as casualwear.

63
00:02:06,740 --> 00:02:08,140
我们能聊点开心的事吗
Can we please talk about something happy,

64
00:02:08,540 --> 00:02:10,160
比如我即将去墨西哥度蜜月
like my honeymoon in Mexico?

65
00:02:10,500 --> 00:02:12,860
对了 你最好看一下天气频道
Oh, yeah, you're gonna want to take a look at the weather channel.

66
00:02:13,580 --> 00:02:14,020
你真幽默
Hilarious.

67
00:02:14,220 --> 00:02:14,660
爱你
Love you.

68
00:02:14,800 --> 00:02:15,460
我也爱你
Love you, too.

69
00:02:16,100 --> 00:02:17,400
你今天会去拿礼物吧
You're gonna get the gift today, right?

70
00:02:17,640 --> 00:02:18,700
我们不是有很多时间做这事吗
Don't we have a year to do that?

71
00:02:18,780 --> 00:02:20,560
不 我有个老公要做这件事
No, I have a husband to do that.

72
00:02:20,680 --> 00:02:21,440
他们看上了
They fell in love with

73
00:02:21,440 --> 00:02:25,120
一个独特的绿松石色意式玻璃碗
this very specific turquoise Italian glass bowl.

74
00:02:25,120 --> 00:02:27,080
我到处找 才终于找到一个
I looked everywhere, finally found one,

75
00:02:27,080 --> 00:02:28,500
我们必须带着那个去参加婚礼
and we're not going to that wedding without it.

76
00:02:28,580 --> 00:02:30,360
等等 我以为你会带我去看眼科医生
Wait. I-I thought you were taking me to the eye doctor.

77
00:02:30,440 --> 00:02:32,000
他们说我不可以自己开车回家
They said I'm not supposed to drive myself home.

78
00:02:32,080 --> 00:02:33,020
不不不
No, no, no, no.

79
00:02:33,020 --> 00:02:34,860
我要把卢克从荒野探险那里接回来
I'm picking up Luke from his wilderness trip.

80
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:35,820
艾丽克斯会载你去
Alex can take you.

81
00:02:35,920 --> 00:02:36,660
真失望
That's a bummer.

82
00:02:36,660 --> 00:02:38,069
老爸 我深受感动
Aww, dad, I'm touched.

83
00:02:38,080 --> 00:02:40,080
不 不是说你 我只是宁愿去接卢克
No, not because of you. I'd just rather pick up Luke.

84
00:02:41,059 --> 00:02:43,037
也不要去看眼科医生
Than go to the eye doctor.

85
00:02:43,110 --> 00:02:45,120
我 我喜欢跟你在一起
I-I love spending time with you.

86
00:02:45,120 --> 00:02:46,260
别担心 你很有趣
Don't worry -- you're fun.

87
00:02:48,160 --> 00:02:49,440
我老爸从来不承认
My dad would never admit this,

88
00:02:49,440 --> 00:02:50,200
但当他想找乐子的时候
but when he wants fun,

89
00:02:50,200 --> 00:02:51,260
他就直接去找卢克
he goes straight to Luke.

90
00:02:51,460 --> 00:02:52,800
他们之间有种奇怪的默契
They have a weird connection.

91
00:02:52,800 --> 00:02:54,360
就像蝙蝠侠和罗宾
They're like Batman and Robin.

92
00:02:55,200 --> 00:02:56,100
老爸和我则更像蝙蝠侠
Dad and I are more like

93
00:02:56,100 --> 00:02:57,780
和鲁思·金斯伯格[美国大法官]
Batman and Ruth Bader Ginsburg.

94
00:02:58,620 --> 00:03:00,020
乖女儿 别那样
Honey, don't be like that.

95
00:03:00,020 --> 00:03:01,100
你真的非常有趣
You're super fun!

96
00:03:01,960 --> 00:03:03,060
你确定我不能去接卢克吗
You sure I can't get Luke?

97
00:03:03,480 --> 00:03:04,260
我听到了
I heard that!

98
00:03:04,340 --> 00:03:05,320
我们走吧
Let's do this!

99
00:03:07,060 --> 00:03:07,540
你好
Hello.

100
00:03:08,020 --> 00:03:09,320
老妈 歌洛莉亚想问你
Hey, mom. Gloria wants to know

101
00:03:09,320 --> 00:03:10,680
她能不能在我和小卡的妈妈之后
if she can do your hair and makeup last

102
00:03:10,680 --> 00:03:11,982
再帮你做头发和化妆
after me and Cam's mom.

103
00:03:13,500 --> 00:03:14,300
她说没事
It's fine.

104
00:03:14,460 --> 00:03:15,800
还有关于卢克的事情 我没兴趣听了
Something about Luke -- I've lost interest.

105
00:03:16,040 --> 00:03:17,300
好的 爱你 再见
Okay, love you. Bye!

106
00:03:17,300 --> 00:03:19,956
天啊 这是我喝过最棒的咖啡了
Damn, this is the best cup of coffee I ever had.

107
00:03:19,956 --> 00:03:23,100
曼尼每周五晚都亲手烘培咖啡豆
Manny roasts his own beans every friday night.

108
00:03:23,100 --> 00:03:25,320
那孩子会需要自撸"小豆豆"很多年的
That kid's gonna be roasting his own beans for a long time,

109
00:03:25,320 --> 00:03:26,140
你懂我的意思吧
if you know what I mean.

110
00:03:26,640 --> 00:03:30,300
我要再次感谢你们让我们住在这里
Can I just say thank you again for letting us stay here?

111
00:03:30,400 --> 00:03:33,500
那一大袋鹿肉已经充分表达了你的谢意
You have thanked us enough with that big bag of deer meat.

112
00:03:33,960 --> 00:03:34,500
妈
Hey, mom.

113
00:03:35,200 --> 00:03:37,240
你能看到这个吗
Can you see this?

114
00:03:37,585 --> 00:03:38,200
什么痘痘
What pimple?

115
00:03:38,220 --> 00:03:39,240
我就知道
I knew it.

116
00:03:39,260 --> 00:03:40,740
我不能这副模样去婚礼
I can't go looking like this.

117
00:03:40,940 --> 00:03:42,080
婚礼上有很多姑娘的
Weddings are where you meet girls.

118
00:03:42,260 --> 00:03:43,240
这场婚礼上没有
Not at this one.

119
00:03:44,077 --> 00:03:45,500
-我们还是走吧 -没错
- Well, we better be going. - Yeah.

120
00:03:45,500 --> 00:03:46,800
好好享受水疗
Have a great spa day.

121
00:03:47,060 --> 00:03:48,260
男人才不做水疗
Men don't have spa days.

122
00:03:48,260 --> 00:03:50,860
我们要去俱乐部里 蒸蒸桑拿
We're just going to the club, taking a steam,

123
00:03:50,870 --> 00:03:52,463
按摩按摩
having a couple of rubdowns.

124
00:03:53,177 --> 00:03:55,637
那地方提供黄瓜水吗
Do they serve cucumber water at that place?

125
00:03:55,647 --> 00:03:58,128
他们有时候会做草莓罗勒汁
Sometimes they do a strawberry-basil mix.

126
00:03:58,454 --> 00:04:00,108
-莫尔 -何事 女士
- Merle? - Yes, ma'am?

127
00:04:00,200 --> 00:04:02,500
准时回来我给你系领带
Be back in time for me to do your tie.

128
00:04:02,500 --> 00:04:03,615
好的 女士
Uh, yes, ma'am.

129
00:04:07,020 --> 00:04:09,240
我很抱歉让你看到这个
I'm so sorry you had to see that.

130
00:04:09,500 --> 00:04:10,120
看到什么
See what?

131
00:04:10,360 --> 00:04:12,160
我们刚刚那样训斥了对方
The way we just snapped at each other.

132
00:04:12,360 --> 00:04:13,360
你在开玩笑吗
Are you joking?

133
00:04:13,700 --> 00:04:17,600
显然 莫尔和我正在闹矛盾
Obviously, Merle and I are going through a heck of a rough patch.

134
00:04:17,600 --> 00:04:19,820
如果我那么友善地跟杰说话
If I talked to Jay that nice,

135
00:04:19,980 --> 00:04:21,520
他会以为我对他不忠呢
he would think I'm cheating on him.

136
00:04:21,920 --> 00:04:22,796
普太太
Mrs. P...

137
00:04:23,500 --> 00:04:25,100
我预约的出租车没有来
...my darn taxi never came.

138
00:04:25,261 --> 00:04:26,385
我要错过我的航班了
I'm gonna miss my flight.

139
00:04:26,400 --> 00:04:26,820
不是吧
No.

140
00:04:27,140 --> 00:04:27,660
我只是
I just --

141
00:04:27,660 --> 00:04:30,010
现在碰到这状况真烦
I don't want to deal with this right now

142
00:04:30,309 --> 00:04:32,040
我本来已经很害怕坐飞机了
'cause I'm already so scared of flying.

143
00:04:32,040 --> 00:04:33,940
我讨厌关于坐飞机的一切
I just hate everything about it --

144
00:04:34,240 --> 00:04:35,080
除了飞机上的食物
Except for the food.

145
00:04:35,160 --> 00:04:37,280
不知道在那么小一间厨房里是怎么做出
I don't understand how they get such bold flavors

146
00:04:37,280 --> 00:04:38,340
那么丰盛香浓的食物的
out of that tiny kitchen.

147
00:04:38,760 --> 00:04:41,580
海莉 你能开车载安迪去机场吗
Haley, can you drive Andy to the airport, please?

148
00:04:41,640 --> 00:04:42,740
她不想载我去啦
She doesn't want to do that.

149
00:04:42,740 --> 00:04:44,627
你懂我
Aww, you get me.

150
00:04:44,720 --> 00:04:45,160
海莉
Haley.

151
00:04:45,260 --> 00:04:47,200
我没车 是别人载我过来的
I don't have a car. I got dropped off.

152
00:04:47,487 --> 00:04:49,093
我想我们可以开我的车
I guess we can take my car.

153
00:04:49,540 --> 00:04:51,040
就这么定了 去吧
That's settled. Go.

154
00:04:51,520 --> 00:04:52,000
好吧
Fine.

155
00:04:52,239 --> 00:04:53,014
好了
Okay.

156
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:55,220
我们真的得赶紧
We really need to hurry.

157
00:04:55,480 --> 00:04:56,740
别紧张 我们会按时赶到的
Relax. We'll get there.

158
00:04:56,900 --> 00:04:57,800
你只需担心
You just worry about

159
00:04:57,800 --> 00:04:59,180
被困在离地三万英尺的
being strapped in a giant metal tube

160
00:04:59,180 --> 00:05:00,551
巨大金属管子里
30,000 feet in the air.

161
00:05:00,560 --> 00:05:02,020
没错 我听到了
That's right -- I heard.

162
00:05:05,820 --> 00:05:06,940
-喂 -干什么
- Hey. - What?

163
00:05:07,380 --> 00:05:08,420
我刚想到一件事
I just thought of something.

164
00:05:08,480 --> 00:05:10,040
我的头发今天会怎么样
What's going on with my hair today?

165
00:05:10,200 --> 00:05:12,320
爸爸会把你的头发盘起来插上花朵
Daddy's going to do it up really pretty with flowers.

166
00:05:12,980 --> 00:05:14,260
不是你吧
Not you, right?

167
00:05:14,320 --> 00:05:15,160
不 是另一个爸爸
No, other daddy.

168
00:05:15,440 --> 00:05:16,560
谢天谢地
Oh, thank god.

169
00:05:16,560 --> 00:05:18,400
米奇尔 这不是我的礼服
Mitchell, this is not my tuxedo!

170
00:05:18,540 --> 00:05:19,400
他们给错了
They gave me the wrong order!

171
00:05:19,600 --> 00:05:21,260
那紫红色的礼裙都没让你看出来吗
And the fuchsia gown didn't tip you off?

172
00:05:21,360 --> 00:05:22,400
我有九件这种颜色的衬衫
I have like nine shirts this color.

173
00:05:22,480 --> 00:05:23,420
我现在穿的衬衫就是这颜色的
I'm wearing a shirt this color.

174
00:05:23,500 --> 00:05:24,820
好了 深呼吸 深呼吸
Okay, deep breaths. Deep breaths.

175
00:05:24,920 --> 00:05:25,920
我们有足够时间去干洗店
We have plenty of time to go to the dry-cleaner.

176
00:05:26,700 --> 00:05:28,220
我们知道今天会有磨难
We knew that there would be a bump today,

177
00:05:28,220 --> 00:05:29,880
这就是 我们要早点办好
and here it is. We're getting it done early.

178
00:05:30,060 --> 00:05:30,980
这是我们的磨难
This is our bump.

179
00:05:33,900 --> 00:05:36,340
好吧 这才是我们的磨难
Okay, okay, so this is our bump.

180
00:05:42,720 --> 00:05:43,940
我应付不来了
I can't handle this.

181
00:05:44,200 --> 00:05:45,760
我们五小时后就要结婚了
We're getting married in five hours,

182
00:05:45,760 --> 00:05:47,580
而我没有精心裁剪的礼服
I don't have my perfectly tailored tux.

183
00:05:47,800 --> 00:05:49,180
我不能去买一件现成的
I can't just go buy something off the rack.

184
00:05:49,300 --> 00:05:50,400
我又不是超模辛迪·克劳馥
I'm not Cindy Crawford.

185
00:05:50,680 --> 00:05:51,320
为什么把自己比作女人
Why a woman?

186
00:05:51,780 --> 00:05:52,460
我只是好奇
I'm just wondering.

187
00:05:52,460 --> 00:05:53,560
我们要怎么办
What are we gonna do?

188
00:05:53,560 --> 00:05:54,500
我们可以吃东西啊
We could eat.

189
00:05:54,620 --> 00:05:56,100
我们需要和店主取得联系
We just need to get in touch with the owner.

190
00:05:56,100 --> 00:05:57,800
你知道他的名字 对吧
Y-you, uh, you know his name, right?

191
00:05:57,800 --> 00:05:59,100
是阿齐兹什么的
It's...Aziz something? .

192
00:05:59,100 --> 00:06:00,897
不 是阿米尔
Oh, oh it's -- it's -- uh, no, it's A-Amir.

193
00:06:00,897 --> 00:06:01,412
不是阿米尔 不是
It's -- it's not amir, no.

194
00:06:01,412 --> 00:06:02,840
是阿玛德
Oh, no, it's, uh, Ahmad.

195
00:06:02,849 --> 00:06:03,500
是艾哈迈德
It's Achmed.

196
00:06:03,500 --> 00:06:04,600
收据上有写
No. Oh, it's on the ticket.

197
00:06:04,600 --> 00:06:05,820
我现在觉得自己种族歧视
Now I'm just feeling racist.

198
00:06:05,820 --> 00:06:06,940
-是什么 -在这里
- What is it? - Here it is.

199
00:06:07,300 --> 00:06:07,840
-是 -杰瑞
- It's... - Jerry.

200
00:06:07,840 --> 00:06:09,588
-好吧 杰瑞 -阿马里
- J-- oh, Jerry. - Amari.

201
00:06:09,588 --> 00:06:10,569
杰瑞·阿马里
Jerry Amari.

202
00:06:10,840 --> 00:06:12,220
知道了
There you go.

203
00:06:13,360 --> 00:06:14,400
在这里看得清楚些了吗
Can you see better in here?

204
00:06:14,400 --> 00:06:16,720
好一点 但眼药水的效果还在
A little, but those drops are really hanging on.

205
00:06:17,080 --> 00:06:19,380
我就像是从爆炸现场走出来的韩·索罗
I'm like Han Solo right when he came out of the carbonite.

206
00:06:20,340 --> 00:06:21,060
真的吗 你没点反应
Really? Nothing?

207
00:06:21,060 --> 00:06:22,320
我知道 是《星际迷航》
I get it. It's "Star Trek."

208
00:06:22,320 --> 00:06:23,320
你简直伤透我的心了
You're breaking my heart.

209
00:06:23,320 --> 00:06:24,880
在卢克面前说吧 他会很喜欢的
Save it for Luke. He'll love that.

210
00:06:24,880 --> 00:06:26,100
我们能不能买完礼物就走啊
Can we just get the gift and get out of here?

211
00:06:26,160 --> 00:06:27,260
好 但是先办重要的事
Right, but first things first.

212
00:06:27,260 --> 00:06:28,400
我们来戴滑稽的帽子
Let's put on some funny hats,

213
00:06:28,480 --> 00:06:29,360
然后装成没戴的样子
act like they're not there,

214
00:06:29,360 --> 00:06:30,600
然后严肃地走来走去
and then walk around all serious.

215
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:32,080
这有什么意义
What's the point of this?

216
00:06:32,180 --> 00:06:33,640
很好 你很严肃
That's good. You're nailing it.

217
00:06:36,064 --> 00:06:36,950
喂 亲爱的
Hey, honey.

218
00:06:36,960 --> 00:06:38,180
眼科检查怎么样
How was the eye exam?

219
00:06:38,300 --> 00:06:38,660
超棒
Great.

220
00:06:38,840 --> 00:06:39,660
我都看不清了
I can barely see.

221
00:06:39,660 --> 00:06:41,860
我戴着一副超大的墨镜和很娘的帽子
I'm wearing giant sunglasses and a girly hat.

222
00:06:41,860 --> 00:06:42,980
艾丽克斯和我玩得很开心
Alex and I are having a blast.

223
00:06:43,140 --> 00:06:44,380
但你取到礼物了吧
But you got the gift, right?

224
00:06:44,380 --> 00:06:45,600
人们都是那样夸我的
That's what people tell me.

225
00:06:45,900 --> 00:06:46,640
亲爱的 我是说碗
Honey, the bowl.

226
00:06:46,840 --> 00:06:47,920
我拿到碗了
I have the bowl.

227
00:06:48,100 --> 00:06:48,960
很漂亮
It's beautiful.

228
00:06:48,960 --> 00:06:50,354
我们回家见
I'll -- I'll see you at home.

229
00:06:50,627 --> 00:06:51,340
我有个想法
Hey, here's a thought --

230
00:06:51,340 --> 00:06:52,780
既然你告诉妈妈你拿到了碗
Now that you told mom you got the bowl,

231
00:06:52,780 --> 00:06:54,080
不如我们真的去取吧
how about we actually go get it?

232
00:06:54,080 --> 00:06:55,420
好 别再闹着玩了
Yes, no more fooling around.

233
00:06:55,460 --> 00:06:56,360
我们去买碗
Let's go get the bowl.

234
00:06:56,520 --> 00:06:58,100
先让我们搞清楚睡眠指数吧
Oh, right after we find out our sleep number.

235
00:07:00,880 --> 00:07:02,600
我儿子来了
There's my guy.

236
00:07:02,960 --> 00:07:04,520
我还以为是我爸爸来接我
I thought dad was picking me up.

237
00:07:04,520 --> 00:07:06,220
我也好想你
Oh. I missed you, too.

238
00:07:06,220 --> 00:07:06,860
来吧
Come here.

239
00:07:09,240 --> 00:07:10,580
你玩得开心吗
So, did you have fun?

240
00:07:11,020 --> 00:07:11,460
是的
Yeah.

241
00:07:11,800 --> 00:07:12,720
你最喜欢哪部分
What was your favorite thing?

242
00:07:13,100 --> 00:07:13,820
我不记得了
I don't remember.

243
00:07:13,820 --> 00:07:15,080
就是昨天的事
It was yesterday.

244
00:07:15,800 --> 00:07:17,500
热狗 现在能走了吗
Hot dogs. Can we go now?

245
00:07:17,600 --> 00:07:19,280
亲爱的 你要提前离开我真心抱歉
Honey, I feel bad that you have to leave early.

246
00:07:19,340 --> 00:07:20,180
你今天错过了什么
What are you missing today?

247
00:07:20,800 --> 00:07:21,160
划船
Boating.

248
00:07:21,660 --> 00:07:23,740
还有时间去玩一玩嘛
Well, I mean, we have a little time.

249
00:07:23,740 --> 00:07:25,430
你不介意在车里等着吗
You don't mind waiting in the car?

250
00:07:29,940 --> 00:07:32,820
小卡告诉我 你和米奇起了点争执
So, Cam tells me you and Mitch had a little dust-up.

251
00:07:34,240 --> 00:07:34,720
是啊
Yeah.

252
00:07:34,760 --> 00:07:36,220
几周前
A couple of weeks ago.

253
00:07:37,320 --> 00:07:38,920
那孩子会记仇
That kid can hold a grudge.

254
00:07:39,328 --> 00:07:42,028
你去参加婚礼有点不爽吧
A little uncomfortable about that wedding, are you?

255
00:07:42,028 --> 00:07:43,781
你知道我的感受 对吧
Well, you know what I'm feeling, right?

256
00:07:45,442 --> 00:07:48,356
我觉得我在这问题上更为开明
I'd like to think I've evolved on the subject.

257
00:07:48,580 --> 00:07:51,680
我们池塘里有一对同性恋天鹅
We got a couple of lesbo swans in the pond.

258
00:07:52,080 --> 00:07:53,480
它们好像很快乐
They seem pretty happy.

259
00:07:55,080 --> 00:07:55,660
杰
Hey, Jay.

260
00:07:55,720 --> 00:07:57,760
霍华德 拉里
Hey, Howard, Larry.

261
00:07:58,480 --> 00:08:00,940
这是我的...
This is my, uh...

262
00:08:01,320 --> 00:08:04,220
这是我朋友莫尔 他从密苏里州过来玩
This is my friend Merle, and he's visiting from Missouri.

263
00:08:04,220 --> 00:08:06,720
是那个"眼见为信”的州啊[拿给我看]
Ooh, the "Show me" state.

264
00:08:06,720 --> 00:08:07,880
别在这里说啊
Don't say that in here!

265
00:08:12,060 --> 00:08:13,900
你怎么到这里来了 莫尔
So, what brings you to town, Merle?

266
00:08:14,300 --> 00:08:17,593
我的... 我们的...
Well, uh, my -- our --

267
00:08:18,761 --> 00:08:23,780
杰和我的孩子今天要结婚了
Jay's and my...kids are getting married today.

268
00:08:23,780 --> 00:08:24,240
恭喜
Congratulations.

269
00:08:24,420 --> 00:08:25,460
真是太棒了
Isn't that nice?

270
00:08:25,560 --> 00:08:27,360
新娘和新郎的父亲
Father of the bride, father of the groom

271
00:08:27,560 --> 00:08:29,420
在结婚当天一起蒸桑拿
taking a steam together the day of the wedding.

272
00:08:29,520 --> 00:08:30,640
是这样
Yeah, something like that.

273
00:08:31,020 --> 00:08:33,200
我儿子结婚的那天 轻松愉快
The day my son got married -- piece of cake.

274
00:08:33,420 --> 00:08:35,020
但当我送走我小女儿时
But the day I lost my little girl --

275
00:08:35,020 --> 00:08:36,930
真是让我伤心死了
Ohh, that wrecked me.

276
00:08:37,020 --> 00:08:39,360
今天你们谁要经历这种痛苦啊
So, which one of you has to suffer through that today?

277
00:08:40,760 --> 00:08:42,220
知道吗 这里太热了
You know what? It's too hot in here.

278
00:08:42,220 --> 00:08:43,136
-是啊 -我们走吧
- Yeah. - Let's go.

279
00:08:43,206 --> 00:08:45,440
你真开明
Mm-hmm. Real evolved.

280
00:08:45,440 --> 00:08:46,740
你的天鹅会为你感到羞耻的
Your swans would be ashamed.

281
00:08:48,840 --> 00:08:52,400
帕梅隆搬走后 我才第一次发现
Well, I guess I first noticed it after Pameron moved out,

282
00:08:52,440 --> 00:08:53,860
莫尔和我开始
and Merle and I just started

283
00:08:53,860 --> 00:08:55,360
出口伤人
sniping at each other.

284
00:08:55,360 --> 00:08:57,545
像今天早上那场唇枪舌剑一样吗
Yeah, like that bloodbath this morning?

285
00:08:57,545 --> 00:09:00,219
我再次道歉
Ohh. Again, I am so sorry.

286
00:09:00,240 --> 00:09:03,960
但你没法和莫尔心平气和谈事情
But Merle is not the type you can talk to about things.

287
00:09:03,960 --> 00:09:06,740
我们结婚期间 他嘴里一直
I mean, the man's had a toothpick in his mouth

288
00:09:06,740 --> 00:09:09,720
叼着一根牙签 我什么也不能说
our whole marriage, and I can't say a word.

289
00:09:09,767 --> 00:09:11,880
你不能压抑感情
No, you can't sit on your feelings.

290
00:09:11,880 --> 00:09:12,880
这样会爆发的
You will explode!

291
00:09:13,015 --> 00:09:16,500
我每天都会小爆发十次
I have, like, 10 little explosions every day,

292
00:09:16,500 --> 00:09:17,980
这样就不会大爆发
so I don't have the big one.

293
00:09:18,795 --> 00:09:19,800
我家族里的女人
The women in my family --

294
00:09:19,800 --> 00:09:21,280
有时候会对着丈夫开枪
sometimes, they shoot their husbands.

295
00:09:21,818 --> 00:09:25,452
我们愉快地相处了48年
Well, we've had 48...good years.

296
00:09:25,452 --> 00:09:28,900
我想我们没时间了
I...guess we're just gonna run out the clock.

297
00:09:28,900 --> 00:09:29,460
不会
No!

298
00:09:30,620 --> 00:09:31,900
你还是...
You're still...

299
00:09:32,780 --> 00:09:33,900
你还有...
You have...

300
00:09:34,540 --> 00:09:35,860
这态度不好
That is bad attitude!

301
00:09:36,220 --> 00:09:39,040
你必须告诉莫尔你烦恼的事
You have to tell Merle what is bothering you.

302
00:09:39,140 --> 00:09:41,100
他一点也不想听
Oh, he doesn't want to hear all that.

303
00:09:41,180 --> 00:09:44,340
他完全听不进去意见
He gets all closed off and macho.

304
00:09:46,594 --> 00:09:48,880
你在挠我的脚趾
You're ticklin' my piggies.

305
00:09:48,880 --> 00:09:49,920
你会习惯的
You get used to that.

306
00:09:50,960 --> 00:09:53,980
真遗憾米奇尔的母亲不能来参加婚礼
It's a shame Mitchell's mother couldn't make it to the wedding.

307
00:09:54,440 --> 00:09:54,920
对谁来说遗憾
For who?

308
00:09:56,001 --> 00:09:58,540
你们关系还那么紧张吗
Mm, things still rough between the two of you?

309
00:09:58,540 --> 00:10:00,980
莫尔 我们关系一直不好
Merle, things have always been rough.

310
00:10:01,180 --> 00:10:03,080
那女人永远都在抱怨
That woman never stopped complaining.

311
00:10:03,721 --> 00:10:07,099
鼓足勇气离开迪迪是我做过的
Finding the strength to leave Dede is the hardest thing I ever did,

312
00:10:07,420 --> 00:10:09,520
最艰难却也最正确的决定
but the best decision I ever made.

313
00:10:09,880 --> 00:10:12,420
能娶到歌洛莉亚是你的福气
Well, you sure made a score with that Gloria.

314
00:10:12,850 --> 00:10:13,894
绝对的
Big-time.

315
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:16,500
我打赌
I bet you landed her

316
00:10:16,500 --> 00:10:19,060
你拿下她之前没给她看过你的臭脚丫
before she got a gander at those hooves of yours.

317
00:10:20,140 --> 00:10:21,460
顺便说一句 不用谢
You're welcome, by the way.

318
00:10:23,380 --> 00:10:24,780
你准备在犹他做点什么
So, what are you gonna do in Utah?

319
00:10:25,900 --> 00:10:27,660
我和我女朋友
Well, me and my girlfriend

320
00:10:27,660 --> 00:10:29,260
很长时间没见面了
haven't seen each other in a while,

321
00:10:29,260 --> 00:10:32,260
所以我们会像两只兔宝宝一样
So we're gonna be like a couple of bunny rabbits...

322
00:10:33,160 --> 00:10:34,600
到哪都粘在一起
just hopping all over town.

323
00:10:36,660 --> 00:10:37,600
这是她吗
Is this her?

324
00:10:38,040 --> 00:10:39,420
对 我的贝丝
Yep, that's my Beth.

325
00:10:40,180 --> 00:10:41,380
她很漂亮
Huh. She's pretty.

326
00:10:41,865 --> 00:10:45,220
没错 她是我的女神 内外兼修
Yeah. She's the most beautiful creature, inside and out.

327
00:10:45,360 --> 00:10:47,720
爱上她是我的幸运
I'm just the luckiest guy ever to get to love her.

328
00:10:48,140 --> 00:10:49,660
好吧 她也许是真实存在的
Okay, she may be real,

329
00:10:49,700 --> 00:10:50,660
但你太假了
but no way you are.

330
00:10:50,660 --> 00:10:51,700
谁会说那种话
Who talks like that?

331
00:10:51,720 --> 00:10:53,500
我不喜欢你这样说话
You know, I hate when you say things like that

332
00:10:53,500 --> 00:10:55,620
因为你风趣 又漂亮
because you are funny, and you are pretty,

333
00:10:55,620 --> 00:10:57,820
你也很聪明 有你自己的方式
and you are smart and in an original way,

334
00:10:57,820 --> 00:10:59,560
为什么不能有人觉得爱上你是一种幸运呢
so why shouldn't a guy feel lucky to love you?

335
00:10:59,700 --> 00:11:01,180
闭嘴 别调戏姐
Shut up. Be normal.

336
00:11:02,180 --> 00:11:03,980
-我手机振了 能帮我看看吗 -好
- Hey, my phone just buzzed. Can you read it? - Yeah.

337
00:11:04,360 --> 00:11:06,080
我不想边开车边看手机
I don't want to put our lives at risk.

338
00:11:08,371 --> 00:11:10,380
是航空公司发来的
It's, uh, it's from the airline.

339
00:11:10,380 --> 00:11:11,920
你的航班延误三个小时
Your flight's delayed three hours.

340
00:11:12,220 --> 00:11:13,860
-三个小时 -是啊
- Three hours?! - Yeah.

341
00:11:14,341 --> 00:11:15,641
怎么会这样
Ohh! Jinkies!

342
00:11:16,080 --> 00:11:18,460
要不你找个咖啡厅把我放下
I guess we can just drop me off at a coffee shop,

343
00:11:18,460 --> 00:11:19,720
我到时自己打车过去
and I can take a cab from there.

344
00:11:20,060 --> 00:11:20,480
好
Okay.

345
00:11:22,940 --> 00:11:24,640
事实上 我有点困
Actually, I really need to wake up.

346
00:11:24,660 --> 00:11:26,620
不介意的话 我们可以一起喝杯咖啡
Maybe I'll grab a coffee with you, if you don't mind.

347
00:11:26,820 --> 00:11:27,220
当然
Please.

348
00:11:27,760 --> 00:11:28,740
和别人聊聊天
The more I talk to people,

349
00:11:28,760 --> 00:11:30,740
我才比较不容易想象自己的飞机
the less I imagine plummeting to my death

350
00:11:30,740 --> 00:11:32,920
在尖叫和哭喊声中坠毁
in a fiery spiral of screaming and crying.

351
00:11:33,520 --> 00:11:35,380
这不像刚用了卡通人物口头禅的人说的话
Pretty dark for someone who just said "Jinkies."

352
00:11:36,540 --> 00:11:37,660
看起来我们
Well, I guess we have

353
00:11:37,660 --> 00:11:39,480
对"紧急情况"的定义是不一样的
different definitions of "Emergency," then.

354
00:11:39,987 --> 00:11:41,100
我必须要说
You know, I'm just gonna say it --

355
00:11:41,100 --> 00:11:43,020
警察局接线员的态度不怎么好
911 dispatchers have a little bit of attitude.

356
00:11:43,020 --> 00:11:44,910
因为你要求他们派特警过来
Well, you requested a S.W.A.T. Team.

357
00:11:45,140 --> 00:11:46,760
还有谁肚子饿吗
Is anybody else hungry?

358
00:11:47,440 --> 00:11:48,760
米奇尔 米奇尔
Mitchell! Mitchell!

359
00:11:48,760 --> 00:11:49,560
看我找到什么了
Look at this.

360
00:11:50,859 --> 00:11:52,000
你觉得你能钻进去吗
Do you think you could fit in there?

361
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:52,940
我不会那么做的
I'm not doing that.

362
00:11:52,940 --> 00:11:54,700
那婚礼上我要穿什么
Then what am I gonna wear to our wedding --

363
00:11:54,700 --> 00:11:55,700
难道穿我的黑色葬礼服吗
My black funeral suit?

364
00:11:55,700 --> 00:11:57,000
你想给婚礼定那种基调吗
Is that the tone you want to set?

365
00:11:57,120 --> 00:11:58,460
你只穿去过一个葬礼
You wore it to one funeral.

366
00:11:58,460 --> 00:11:59,900
而且你和毕·亚瑟[演员]又不认识
And you didn't even know Bea Arthur.

367
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:01,340
-我觉得我认识 -我知道
- I felt like I did. - I know.

368
00:12:02,980 --> 00:12:04,880
是胡娇 他会知道该怎么做
It's Pepper. He'll know what to do.

369
00:12:05,080 --> 00:12:06,640
喂 胡娇 出大事了
Yes. Pepper. Disaster.

370
00:12:06,840 --> 00:12:10,040
不是什么大问题 只是山火罢了
It's not a disaster. It's just a wildfire.

371
00:12:10,060 --> 00:12:12,780
而且我很确定不会烧到你们的婚礼
And it's most certainly not going to burn down your wedding.

372
00:12:12,940 --> 00:12:13,820
-什么 -什么
- What?! - What?

373
00:12:13,940 --> 00:12:15,540
会场旁边有山火
There's a wildfire near the venue.

374
00:12:15,820 --> 00:12:16,220
不是吧
No!

375
00:12:16,220 --> 00:12:17,820
是着火了 不过你放心
Yes, but it's fine.

376
00:12:17,820 --> 00:12:20,270
罗纳多会群发短信通知宾客
Ronaldo is going to text-blast the guest list,

377
00:12:20,270 --> 00:12:23,200
婚礼从5点提前到1点开始
tell them the wedding is being moved from 5:00 to 1:00.

378
00:12:23,200 --> 00:12:24,340
上帝啊
Oh, my god!

379
00:12:24,480 --> 00:12:25,440
别紧张
Don't panic.

380
00:12:26,200 --> 00:12:29,780
有人能把那个该死的瀑布关上吗
Would somebody please turn off that wretched waterfall?!

381
00:12:30,180 --> 00:12:31,740
立即关掉瀑布
Kill the waterfall immediately!

382
00:12:34,040 --> 00:12:36,640
28%的山火已经被扑灭了
The fire is already 28% contained.

383
00:12:36,820 --> 00:12:38,000
听起来不太多
That doesn't sound like a lot.

384
00:12:38,040 --> 00:12:39,500
打扮好自己就行了
Just get dressed and look pretty.

385
00:12:39,540 --> 00:12:41,740
我一个小时后派车去接你们
I'm going to send the car for you in one hour.

386
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:44,820
你疯了吗
Have you lost your mind?!

387
00:12:47,460 --> 00:12:49,200
滚 你真让我恶心
Go! You disgust me!

388
00:12:49,340 --> 00:12:49,860
滚
Go!

389
00:12:52,120 --> 00:12:52,640
好了
Okay.

390
00:12:53,097 --> 00:12:54,440
我们现在怎么办
Now what are we gonna do?

391
00:12:54,440 --> 00:12:55,680
我猜也许
No, I guess maybe --

392
00:12:55,680 --> 00:12:57,948
不 小卡 我不可能钻得进去
No, th-- Cam, there's no way I could fit through there.

393
00:13:01,420 --> 00:13:02,840
我被你们两个烦死了
You two exhaust me.

394
00:13:05,080 --> 00:13:05,600
什么
What?

395
00:13:05,940 --> 00:13:07,540
我们一个小时后就得到
We have to be there in an hour!

396
00:13:07,880 --> 00:13:09,560
我不能就这么去
I can't go like this!

397
00:13:09,800 --> 00:13:10,660
瞧我什么样儿啊
Look at me!

398
00:13:11,340 --> 00:13:12,380
我讨厌你
I hate you.

399
00:13:12,840 --> 00:13:15,420
准备享用你人生中最美味的汉堡吧
Prepare yourself for the best burger of your life.

400
00:13:19,140 --> 00:13:20,900
我们得走了
We got to go.

401
00:13:24,340 --> 00:13:25,620
也许我们该再试几顶帽子
Maybe we should try on more hats.

402
00:13:25,700 --> 00:13:26,480
你觉得我们还有时间吗
Do you think we have time?

403
00:13:27,760 --> 00:13:28,860
坏了
It's not working!

404
00:13:29,515 --> 00:13:30,760
没有桨吗
And there's no oar?

405
00:13:31,120 --> 00:13:33,460
我们现在真的是进退两难了
We are literally up a creek without a paddle?

406
00:13:34,060 --> 00:13:35,600
莉莉 莉莉
Okay, Lily, Lily!

407
00:13:36,026 --> 00:13:38,029
你要按绿色的按钮让它启动
Okay, you're gonna press the green button to start it,

408
00:13:38,029 --> 00:13:41,500
然后找到9-1-3号
and then you're gonna look for number 9-1-3.

409
00:13:41,500 --> 00:13:43,060
然后当它经过你旁边时
And then, when you see it go by,

410
00:13:43,140 --> 00:13:44,920
按红色的按钮让它停止 懂了吗
you press the red button to stop it, okay?

411
00:13:45,700 --> 00:13:46,140
好了
Okay.

412
00:13:46,293 --> 00:13:48,172
真高兴你在这
Oh, I'm so glad you're here.

413
00:13:48,200 --> 00:13:50,000
每次陷于这种境地我就急得发疯
I get us into these situations, and I freak,

414
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:51,440
然后你总能解决问题
and then you always fix the problem.

415
00:13:51,440 --> 00:13:53,160
我们每个人都有自己的天赋
Well, now, we each have our own gifts.

416
00:13:53,160 --> 00:13:54,960
只是我比较容易
It's just it's easier for me

417
00:13:54,960 --> 00:13:56,360
在这种情况下保持冷静
to stay calm in the face of --

418
00:13:56,360 --> 00:13:58,540
天啊 天啊 天啊
Oh, my god! Oh, my god! Oh, oh!

419
00:13:58,754 --> 00:14:01,625
-莉莉 爸爸们来了 -天啊
- Lily, Daddies coming for you! - Oh, my god!

420
00:14:05,800 --> 00:14:08,260
现在 莉莉 按红色按钮
Okay, now, Lily, press the red button!

421
00:14:08,340 --> 00:14:09,340
我要打碎玻璃
I'm breaking the window!

422
00:14:09,700 --> 00:14:10,540
放下它
Put that down!

423
00:14:11,740 --> 00:14:12,780
谢天谢地你来了
Thank god you're here.

424
00:14:13,020 --> 00:14:14,180
你们要闯进我的店吗
Are you breaking into my store?

425
00:14:16,160 --> 00:14:16,900
不是
Uh, no.

426
00:14:17,060 --> 00:14:18,260
你怎么会那么想
Why would you even say that?

427
00:14:18,700 --> 00:14:19,940
我的警报响了
My alarm went off.

428
00:14:20,100 --> 00:14:21,660
好吧 那是个巧合
Oh, well, okay, that is a coincidence

429
00:14:21,660 --> 00:14:23,340
因为他的礼服在里面
Because his tuxedo is in there,

430
00:14:23,340 --> 00:14:24,880
而且我们一个小时后就要举行婚礼
and we're getting married in an hour.

431
00:14:25,960 --> 00:14:28,140
你简直是大救星
You are totally saving us.

432
00:14:28,140 --> 00:14:30,740
我在这种情况下通常急得发疯
You know, I freak out at situations like this,

433
00:14:30,740 --> 00:14:33,040
于是他不得不出来解决问题
which forces him to fix the problem,

434
00:14:33,055 --> 00:14:34,080
-你懂吧 -我懂 我懂
- You know? - I do. I do.

435
00:14:34,080 --> 00:14:36,360
我在这里急得发疯了
So, I'm over here, freaking out,

436
00:14:36,360 --> 00:14:39,120
而他在别的地方解决问题
while he's somewhere else, fixing the problem.

437
00:14:39,360 --> 00:14:40,600
天啊 我很抱歉
Oh, my gosh. I'm so sorry.

438
00:14:45,300 --> 00:14:47,060
也许那是好事 你知道
Well, maybe that's a good thing, you know --

439
00:14:47,060 --> 00:14:48,060
两个人要互补
the yin, the yang?

440
00:14:48,200 --> 00:14:48,980
随便你怎么说吧 杰瑞
Yeah, whatever, Jerry.

441
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:51,920
她从哪来的
Where'd she come from?

442
00:14:52,020 --> 00:14:53,640
就因为她长得不像我们吗
Oh, oh, because she doesn't look like us?

443
00:14:53,680 --> 00:14:55,120
-你这样歧视很过分 -杰瑞
- That's offensive. - Oh, Jerry.

444
00:14:58,980 --> 00:15:00,440
我们怎么办
What are we going to do?

445
00:15:00,580 --> 00:15:01,540
我知道怎么排到前面去
I know how to get up there.

446
00:15:02,380 --> 00:15:03,780
-我看不见 -跟着我走
- I'm blind. - Follow me.

447
00:15:03,780 --> 00:15:05,368
-我才不干 -艾丽克斯
- Oh, I'm not doing that. - Alex!

448
00:15:10,080 --> 00:15:12,620
不好意思 谁能告诉我在哪排队吗
Excuse me, could someone help me to find the back of the line?

449
00:15:12,620 --> 00:15:13,700
不不 你到前面来吧
Oh, no, no. It's okay.

450
00:15:13,817 --> 00:15:15,497
-就排这里吧 -真的可以吗
- Go right here. - Are you sure?

451
00:15:15,800 --> 00:15:16,400
有什么可以帮您
Can I help you?

452
00:15:16,620 --> 00:15:17,700
我来取邓菲订的东西
Yes, picking up for Dunphy.

453
00:15:17,780 --> 00:15:18,980
我叫人帮我留货了
It's on hold, I believe.

454
00:15:19,280 --> 00:15:21,520
天气不错 我听说
Beautiful day, huh? I was told.

455
00:15:21,900 --> 00:15:24,460
拿来了 信用卡支付吗
Here we go. Credit card?

456
00:15:24,460 --> 00:15:27,740
我想确认一下 是绿松石色的吧
Uh, just to be sure -- that is turquoise, right?

457
00:15:27,740 --> 00:15:29,560
因为我太太说这碗还有翠绿色的
Because my wife said it also comes in emerald.

458
00:15:29,980 --> 00:15:32,040
没错 先生 您后面队很长
Yes. Sir, it's a very long line.

459
00:15:32,595 --> 00:15:34,651
好吧 能给我摸一下吗
Okay. Um, can I have it for one second?

460
00:15:36,920 --> 00:15:37,800
谢谢
Thank you.

461
00:15:39,920 --> 00:15:41,480
但这感觉不像是绿松石色
Yep, that doesn't feel like turquoise.

462
00:15:41,480 --> 00:15:44,440
你可以感觉出颜色吗 开什么玩笑
You can feel color? You got to be kidding me.

463
00:15:44,440 --> 00:15:45,360
当你失去一种感官功能
When you lose one sense,

464
00:15:45,460 --> 00:15:46,760
其他的感官功能就会变得异常敏锐
all your other senses become heightened.

465
00:15:46,880 --> 00:15:48,560
所以我感觉你说话声很大 且充满鄙夷
That's why you sound so loud and judge-y to me.

466
00:15:48,680 --> 00:15:49,480
我的错 先生
My mistake, sir.

467
00:15:49,780 --> 00:15:51,340
-我马上就回 -好的
- I'll be right back. - Okay.

468
00:15:55,480 --> 00:15:56,620
好了
Here it is.

469
00:15:56,800 --> 00:15:58,540
嘿 他在耍盲人呢
Hey, he's messing with the blind guy.

470
00:15:58,620 --> 00:16:00,060
谢谢你 不管你站在哪儿
Thank you -- wherever you are.

471
00:16:00,080 --> 00:16:01,420
我觉得他并非真的瞎了
I don't think he's really blind.

472
00:16:01,540 --> 00:16:02,200
打断一下
Excuse me.

473
00:16:03,060 --> 00:16:04,800
我父亲去洪都拉斯执行人道主义任务时
My father suffered methanol poisoning

474
00:16:04,800 --> 00:16:06,660
遭遇了甲醛中毒事故
on a humanitarian mission in Honduras

475
00:16:06,660 --> 00:16:08,900
造成永久性的神经功能障碍
resulting in permanent neurological dysfunction

476
00:16:08,900 --> 00:16:10,580
和无法治愈的失明
and irreversible blindness.

477
00:16:10,580 --> 00:16:12,100
这对我们家人已经够难以承受的了
It's been hard enough on our family

478
00:16:12,100 --> 00:16:13,720
但你这种人却使情况变得更糟
without people like you making it worse.

479
00:16:13,730 --> 00:16:15,904
如果他感觉这不是我们要的碗
If he feels it's not the bowl,

480
00:16:15,986 --> 00:16:17,723
那就不是
it's not the bowl.

481
00:16:18,160 --> 00:16:19,180
对不起
I'm so sorry.

482
00:16:20,320 --> 00:16:21,420
我去看看绿松石颜色的
I'll check on the turquoise.

483
00:16:23,000 --> 00:16:24,280
好吧 竟然挺有趣的
Okay, that was kind of fun.

484
00:16:24,540 --> 00:16:26,360
我现在就在对你眨眼呢
I'm winking at you right now.

485
00:16:27,554 --> 00:16:30,220
这办法不管用
Ohh, this is not working.

486
00:16:30,220 --> 00:16:32,360
我们永远不可能准时赶到那里的
We are never gonna get there on time,

487
00:16:32,360 --> 00:16:33,960
我可是"伴人"
and I am the best person.

488
00:16:34,500 --> 00:16:35,160
天啊
Oh, god!

489
00:16:36,020 --> 00:16:37,540
我觉得我刚刚在乌龟背上刮断了指甲
I think I just broke a nail on a turtle.

490
00:16:37,900 --> 00:16:39,680
是你非要来这里的
You're the one who wanted to come out here.

491
00:16:39,680 --> 00:16:41,120
是的 没错
Yes, I did,

492
00:16:41,160 --> 00:16:43,340
因为我想跟我儿子共度一些时光
because I wanted to spend some time with my son.

493
00:16:44,018 --> 00:16:44,860
你现在...
You've --

494
00:16:44,860 --> 00:16:46,780
你最近一直疏远我
You've been pushing me away so much lately,

495
00:16:46,780 --> 00:16:48,660
我不希望你长大了变成那种
And I don't want you to grow up to be the kind of kid

496
00:16:48,660 --> 00:16:50,400
不在乎妈妈来不来参加自己婚礼的孩子
who doesn't care if his mom shows up at his wedding.

497
00:16:50,720 --> 00:16:51,800
你在胡说些什么呢
What are you talking about?

498
00:16:52,600 --> 00:16:55,260
外婆今天不来 米奇尔觉得松了一口气
Nana isn't coming today, and Mitchell's relieved.

499
00:16:56,629 --> 00:16:59,057
如果你错过了我的婚礼 我会很难过的
I'd be really sad if you missed my wedding.

500
00:16:59,080 --> 00:17:00,860
真的吗 你保证
Really? You promise?

501
00:17:01,320 --> 00:17:03,200
绝对的 凯特也是
Totally. And so would Kate.

502
00:17:03,220 --> 00:17:03,820
凯特是谁
Who's Kate?

503
00:17:03,820 --> 00:17:07,592
凯特·阿普顿 我妻子 你儿媳
Upton -- my wife, your daughter-in-law.

504
00:17:07,800 --> 00:17:08,740
信息跟上一点啊
Get on board.

505
00:17:08,740 --> 00:17:09,860
拜托
Come on.

506
00:17:09,860 --> 00:17:12,578
你最近是什么情况啊
Then what has been going on with you recently?

507
00:17:12,740 --> 00:17:13,700
总是闷闷不乐的
You've been so moody.

508
00:17:14,160 --> 00:17:16,240
对不起 但我真的很讨厌每天去学校
I'm sorry, but I'm sick of going school

509
00:17:16,240 --> 00:17:17,240
都听老师说
and hearing teachers say,

510
00:17:17,240 --> 00:17:19,187
"你是艾丽克斯·邓菲的弟弟吗
"You're Alex Dunphy's brother?

511
00:17:19,240 --> 00:17:20,960
真的假的" 就像我是个蠢货一样
Really?" Like I'm an idiot.

512
00:17:21,200 --> 00:17:22,520
亲爱的 你才不是蠢货呢
Oh, honey, you're not an idiot.

513
00:17:22,700 --> 00:17:23,480
我竟然忘了带桨
I forgot the paddle

514
00:17:23,480 --> 00:17:25,920
何况我们昨天才学了划船必备物品清单
even though we just learned the boating checklist yesterday.

515
00:17:26,180 --> 00:17:27,620
艾丽克斯肯定不会做出这种事的
Alex would never do that.

516
00:17:27,820 --> 00:17:30,140
就算她做了 可能也会...
And if she did, she'd probably, like --

517
00:17:30,460 --> 00:17:31,260
我也说不清
I don't know --

518
00:17:31,380 --> 00:17:35,200
利用这个钓竿甩出去 把我们拉到岸上
use this fishing rod to cast out and hook us on the shore

519
00:17:35,200 --> 00:17:37,000
因为"我好聪明"
because "I'm so smart."

520
00:17:37,000 --> 00:17:38,789
然后她会把我们拉过去
And then she'd pull us in

521
00:17:38,800 --> 00:17:40,920
因为她无论想出什么办法都能行得通
because everything she does always works.

522
00:17:41,400 --> 00:17:43,720
天啊 真的行得通 很有效
Oh, my god. It's working. It's working!

523
00:17:44,980 --> 00:17:46,100
我想也是 艾丽克斯
Figures. Alex.

524
00:17:49,260 --> 00:17:49,620
别动
Don't move.

525
00:17:49,620 --> 00:17:51,210
这会儿的光线真好
The lighting is really cool right now.

526
00:17:52,040 --> 00:17:53,600
你在搞什么啊 别笑
Wh are you doing? Don't smile.

527
00:17:53,600 --> 00:17:54,900
为什么 这是我的最爱
Why? It's my favorite thing.

528
00:17:55,040 --> 00:17:56,820
不 说真的 严肃一点
No, really, be serious.

529
00:17:56,860 --> 00:17:57,580
看向窗外
Look out the window.

530
00:18:01,180 --> 00:18:01,740
看吧
Look.

531
00:18:04,440 --> 00:18:07,200
这真的是别人为我拍过的最帅的照片
That is honestly the best photo anyone's ever taken of me.

532
00:18:07,400 --> 00:18:07,960
谢谢
Thank you.

533
00:18:08,240 --> 00:18:09,580
你介意我发一张给贝丝吗
You mind if I send a copy to Beth?

534
00:18:11,120 --> 00:18:12,200
安迪 那个...
Andy, um...

535
00:18:13,000 --> 00:18:14,980
我之前读航空公司那条短信时
When I read the text about your flight,

536
00:18:15,040 --> 00:18:18,020
也看到贝丝的短信说让你不要去了
I saw the text from Beth telling you not to come.

537
00:18:18,353 --> 00:18:20,290
她并非真的是那个意思
Yeah, she doesn't mean that.

538
00:18:21,300 --> 00:18:22,880
她说 "我们完了"
She said, "It's over."

539
00:18:22,880 --> 00:18:25,120
那可能有各种不同的意思
That can mean a lot of different things.

540
00:18:26,660 --> 00:18:28,140
你的手机又响了
Your phone's buzzing again.

541
00:18:31,540 --> 00:18:33,380
天啊 婚礼提前了
Oh, my god. The wedding got moved up.

542
00:18:33,380 --> 00:18:34,420
我得走了
I have to go.

543
00:18:36,400 --> 00:18:38,300
安迪 你确定要登机飞过去吗
Andy, are you sure about getting on that plane?

544
00:18:38,300 --> 00:18:40,060
是啊 我没事
Yeah, yeah. I-I'm fine.

545
00:18:40,060 --> 00:18:41,960
她偶尔就是会这样的
You know, she does this every once in a while.

546
00:18:42,100 --> 00:18:43,080
她就喜欢跟我闹
She just likes the drama.

547
00:18:43,153 --> 00:18:44,960
-但是我... -海莉
- But I -- okay. - Haley,

548
00:18:44,960 --> 00:18:47,180
我感谢你的关心 真的
I appreciate your concern -- I really do --

549
00:18:47,340 --> 00:18:50,180
但我这段感情断断续续的已经8年了
But I've been in this relationship off and on for eight years,

550
00:18:50,180 --> 00:18:52,440
我很清楚自己在干什么 好吗
So I kind of know what I'm doing, all right?

551
00:18:52,940 --> 00:18:54,140
谢谢你开车送我
Thank you for the ride.

552
00:18:57,340 --> 00:18:58,320
那是我的必备生存工具
It's a tool of the trade.

553
00:18:58,980 --> 00:19:00,180
车钥匙是写着"丰田"的那个
The car one says "Toyota."

554
00:19:06,474 --> 00:19:07,780
我已经看到新郎们了
I have eyes on the grooms.

555
00:19:07,780 --> 00:19:08,960
我就在你身后
I'm three feet behind you.

556
00:19:09,020 --> 00:19:10,220
情况怎么样 客人们都来了吗
How's it going? Are people showing up?

557
00:19:10,320 --> 00:19:11,520
一切尽在掌控之中
It's all under control.

558
00:19:11,980 --> 00:19:14,020
惊喜哦 猜猜谁准时赶到了
Surprise! Guess who's on time.

559
00:19:14,100 --> 00:19:14,620
天啊
Oh, my god!

560
00:19:14,620 --> 00:19:15,860
萨尔 你怀孕了
Sal, wow, you're pregnant.

561
00:19:16,520 --> 00:19:17,000
恭喜啊
Congratulations!

562
00:19:17,240 --> 00:19:19,060
谢谢 我们真的好激动
Thank you. We're really excited.

563
00:19:20,000 --> 00:19:20,960
你真肥
You're huge.

564
00:19:21,400 --> 00:19:22,120
缺牙妹
Nice teeth.

565
00:19:22,120 --> 00:19:23,974
托尼人呢
Uh, so, w-where's Tony?

566
00:19:24,000 --> 00:19:25,000
你真是问倒我了
Oh, beats me.

567
00:19:25,160 --> 00:19:26,400
我们离婚后 就再没跟他说过话了
Haven't spoken to him since the divorce.

568
00:19:26,820 --> 00:19:29,520
现在是埃迪 埃迪 宝贝
Yeah, it's, uh, Eddie. Eddie! Baby!

569
00:19:29,600 --> 00:19:30,600
过来 来见见我的闺蜜们
Come here! Come meet the girls!

570
00:19:31,360 --> 00:19:31,560
埃迪
Eddie.

571
00:19:31,560 --> 00:19:32,620
-这是埃迪 -埃迪
- This is Eddie. - Eddie.

572
00:19:32,620 --> 00:19:35,740
小卡 米奇 胡娇 这家伙
Cam, Mitch, Peps, this guy.

573
00:19:35,900 --> 00:19:37,220
这是埃迪 我儿子他爹
This is Eddie, my baby daddy.

574
00:19:37,400 --> 00:19:38,760
你怎么不告诉我们
So, why didn't you tell us?

575
00:19:38,860 --> 00:19:39,480
你懂的
Oh, you know,

576
00:19:39,480 --> 00:19:41,080
我们想先成功度过前三个月
we just wanted to get through that first trimester

577
00:19:41,080 --> 00:19:42,720
再向大家宣布这件事
before we let the cat out of the bag.

578
00:19:43,180 --> 00:19:44,320
那是什么时候的事 去年夏天吗
When was that -- last summer?

579
00:19:44,320 --> 00:19:46,640
你现在 怀孕多久了
So, y-you're -- you're how far along now?

580
00:19:46,640 --> 00:19:48,480
大约四个月 对吧亲爱的
About four months. Right, honey?

581
00:19:49,340 --> 00:19:52,540
差不多刚好是埃迪和我在一起的时间
Just about the exact amount of time eddie and I have been together.

582
00:19:53,920 --> 00:19:54,960
我不明白
I don't understand.

583
00:19:55,260 --> 00:19:57,020
4是这个数 对吧
Four is this many, yes?

584
00:19:57,147 --> 00:19:58,187
是
Si?

585
00:19:58,418 --> 00:19:59,988
你们好啊 帅哥们
Hola, handsome boys.

586
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:01,120
你们俩看上去美呆了
You two look gorgeous.

587
00:20:01,120 --> 00:20:02,020
-谢谢 -谢谢
- Gracias. - Oh, thank you.

588
00:20:02,020 --> 00:20:04,020
真不错对吧 跟普通婚礼一样
Pretty nice, huh? Like a regular wedding.

589
00:20:04,945 --> 00:20:06,244
就你多嘴 杰
Good start, Jay.

590
00:20:06,420 --> 00:20:08,380
莫尔 今天是你儿子的婚礼
Hey, Merle, it's your son's wedding --

591
00:20:08,540 --> 00:20:09,960
你能把牙签扔掉吗
Maybe lose the toothpick?

592
00:20:11,320 --> 00:20:13,200
我真是受够了你的唠叨
I'm getting tired of this nagging.

593
00:20:13,420 --> 00:20:14,660
-我要抛弃你 -什么
- I'm leaving you. - What?

594
00:20:14,900 --> 00:20:16,800
但我要先抛弃你
Not if I leave you first!

595
00:20:16,800 --> 00:20:18,240
不不不 你不是真心的
No, no, no, you don't mean this!

596
00:20:18,240 --> 00:20:19,760
别内疚 亲爱的
Oh, don't you feel bad, honey.

597
00:20:19,760 --> 00:20:21,000
你今天帮了我大忙
You have helped me today.

598
00:20:21,980 --> 00:20:23,540
谢谢你帮我摆脱大麻烦
Thanks for getting me over the hump.

599
00:20:24,200 --> 00:20:24,960
你干了什么
What did you do?

600
00:20:26,320 --> 00:20:28,340
哇 我们真的要结婚了
Wow. We're doing this

601
00:20:29,140 --> 00:20:29,900
你准备好了吗
Are you ready?

602
00:20:29,900 --> 00:20:32,140
我一分钟都不想等了
I don't want to wait another minute.

603
00:20:32,640 --> 00:20:35,300
莉莉 开始吧
Lily, hit it.

604
00:20:43,324 --> 00:20:44,567
数三下 帅哥们
On 3, boys.

605
00:20:46,260 --> 00:20:48,220
注意 各位请注意
Attention! Attention, please!

606
00:20:48,320 --> 00:20:50,000
大火已经漫过高速了
The fire has jumped the freeway.

607
00:20:50,260 --> 00:20:51,120
真的很抱歉 大伙儿
I'm really sorry, folks.

608
00:20:51,120 --> 00:20:53,670
请所有人立刻撤离
I'm gonna have to evacuate everyone immediately.

609
00:20:55,520 --> 00:20:56,890
这才是我们的磨难
So, this our bump.
